msgctxt "96"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Che ci fai qui?"

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"Truthfully, I've been wanting to pay this orphanage a visit\r\n"
"for some time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"So of course, I didn't waste any time when Kiryu-san here\r\n"
"invited me. I needed to see the children he clearly loves\r\n"
"so much for myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"They'll certainly grow into fine young adults. Is it the\r\n"
"environment? Or perhaps Kiryu-san's guiding hand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "What's your secret?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I can't take that much credit. They're all really\r\n"
"independent. I only step in when absolutely necessary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "I see. You should take a page out of his book, Hashimoto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Yes, sir. I agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Hey, what about Shiro!? He thinks he's better than all us\r\n"
"regular kids 'cause he doesn't have parents!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Don't speak to him like that, young man! He didn't choose\r\n"
"to be an orphan. None of these kids did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"If you were really his friend, you would help him solve\r\n"
"his problems, not make them worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Whatever, you old fart!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Well I never! I feel sorry for that boy's parents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Though I'm sure being his teacher is hard enough, Hashimoto-sensei."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Well... I should be going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"I must say, Kiryu-san, it warms my heart to see how happy\r\n"
"and healthy your children are. You have the full support of\r\n"
"the city, I assure you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Oh, Akasaka-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, Kiryu-san. I told you I'd stop by,\r\n"
"didn't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Yeah, though I wasn't expecting it to be so soon..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! Once an idea crosses my mind, I simply have to see\r\n"
"it through as soon as possible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Taichi in the house!"
msgstr "Taichi è qui!"

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Yo, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Hey, you forgot to say hello to our guest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "And take your shoes off before you go inside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Hi, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "We're home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "You two have a good day at school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "Mhm! Oh, a guest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Hi, Mister!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Hi!"
msgstr "Ciao!"

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Haha. Hello there, kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Come on, Izumi-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "Va bene!"

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Hahaha! Such energetic kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Everything okay, Kiryu-san? You look kinda worried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"Hi there, Miyara-san. It turns out Shiro's been getting\r\n"
"bullied at school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"What!? Who would go after a sweet kid like Shiro-kun?\r\n"
"I'd like to give them a piece of my mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"Well, it's a kid named Yoshinori... but his dad's the real\r\n"
"problem. Apparently he's pretty tight with Akasaka-sensei."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"Meaning if I don't go about this the right way, they'll get\r\n"
"city council to come shut my orphanage down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Really? That doesn't seem like the Akasaka-san I know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Wait, you know him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "Of course. He's famous 'round these parts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"Well, as famous as a city councilman can be. Anyway, he's\r\n"
"definitely the honest type, not the kind of guy to use his\r\n"
"position to settle grudges."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"Why don't you go talk to him? He loves chatting with his\r\n"
"constituents, so I'm sure he'd be willing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"Even so, I can't just go marching into city hall over this.\r\n"
"Maybe if there was somewhere else I could run into him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "Oh, why don't you try the golf course?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "...Why the golf course?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"That's where he spends most of his free time. They say he\r\n"
"wouldn't be caught dead without his trusty set of clubs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"Apparently he loves it so much he forgets to eat sometimes!\r\n"
"But golf balls can't fill an empty stomach, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Huh. I wonder how even he finds time to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"Second that, Kiryu-san. Anyway, the monorail's the best way\r\n"
"there. Just get off at <Color:7>Golf Course Station<Color:Default> and you're golden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"Thanks a ton, Miyara-san. Time to go find out if those\r\n"
"rumors are true."
msgstr ""

